        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "// Turns the start_concept_generation() outcome into the HTTP answer for the web app.\nconst r = $input.first().json;\nconst req = $('Validate request').first().json;\nconst answers = {\n  started: [202, { project_id: req.project_id, status: 'GENERATING_CONCEPTS', accepted: true, concept_count: req.concept_count }],\n  not_found: [422, { error: { code: 'project_not_found', message: 'Project not found.' } }],\n  invalid_state: [409, { error: { code: 'invalid_state', message: `Concepts can't be generated while the project is ${r.current_status}.`, status: r.current_status } }],\n  invalid_request: [422, { error: { code: 'validation_failed', message: 'Invalid request', fields: { concept_count: 'concept_count must be an integer from 2 to 5.' } } }],\n};\nconst [statusCode, responseBody] = answers[r.outcome] ?? [500, { error: { code: 'unexpected', message: 'Unexpected result.' } }];\nreturn [{ json: { statusCode, body: responseBody, started: r.outcome === 'started', project: r, request: req } }];"
      }
